Package: VCVglmm
Title: Manipulating model outputs from MCMCglmm and lme4 objects, usually involving variance-covariance matrices
Date: 2019-12-4
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Max", "Brown", email = "max.brown@ed.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Manipulating model outputs, especially mixed models but also some generic plotting functions and data manipulation.
    Includes convergence diagnostics, variance partitioning and R-squared on the latent, link and data scales,
    and plain-English summaries of MCMCglmm and lme4 models.
Depends: R(>= 3.5.1)
